sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant UI as Account switcher
    participant AP as AccountProvider
    participant Cart as CartRepository (Ch 38)
    participant Tokens as per-account tokens (Ch 20)

    User->>UI: switch to Work account
    UI->>AP: switchTo("work")
    AP->>AP: currentId = "work" (StateFlow emits)
    AP-->>Cart: flatMapLatest -> observe cart WHERE accountId="work"
    Cart-->>UI: Work cart (instant, no network)
    Note over Tokens: requests now use Work's token, Ch 19
    Note over AP: Personal account data untouched, switch back is instant
